13
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The person that looks the closest will be based upon

14
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
the highest average score between each parent and child.

15
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
We're going to use the DeepFace open-source library

16
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
